<li>Alfred Wallace, 'The Malay Archipelago', MacMillan, 1869. Ia mendaki pada tahun 1854.</li>
<li>John Briggs, 'Mountains of Malaysia - A Practical Guide and Manual', Longman, 1985.</li>
